#, no-c-format
msgid "<keycap>T</keycap>"
msgstr "<keycap>T</keycap>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:986
#, no-c-format
msgid "Toggle a trail on the selected object (solar system bodies only)"
msgstr ""
"Conmutar que se vexa un ronsel do obxecto seleccionado (só dos corpos do "
