#. Tag: secondary
#: commands.docbook:1076 commands.docbook:1078
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mouse"
msgstr "Rato"

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1081
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moving the mouse"
msgstr "Movementos do rato"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1082
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The sky coordinates (RA/Dec and Az/Alt) of the mouse cursor are updated in "
"the status bar"
msgstr ""
"As coordenadas do ceo (AR/Dec e Az/Alt) do cursos do rato actualízanse na "
"barra de estado"

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1088
#, no-c-format
msgid "\"Hovering\" the mouse"
msgstr "\"Pasar o rato\""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1089
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A temporary name label is attached to the object nearest to the mouse cursor."
msgstr ""
"Engádeselle unha lenda temporal ao obxecto máis próximo ao cursor do rato."

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1094
#, no-c-format
msgid "Left-clicking"
msgstr "Botón primario do rato"

#. Tag: secondary
#: commands.docbook:1098
#, no-c-format
msgid "Identifying"
msgstr "Identificación"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1098
#, no-c-format
msgid "The object nearest the mouse click is identified in the status bar."
msgstr ""
"Identifícase na barra de estado o obxecto que estea máis perto do clic do "
"rato."

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Double-clicking"
msgstr "Premer dúas veces"

#. Tag: secondary
#: commands.docbook:1108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Centering"
msgstr "Centrado"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Center and track on the location or object nearest the mouse click. Double-"
"clicking on an Info Box will <quote>shade</quote> it to show/hide extra "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Centrer e seguir a localización do obxecto que estea máis preto do clic do "
"rato. Premendo dúas veces un panel informativo \"coloréao\" para mostrar ou "
"acochar información adicional."

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1115
#, no-c-format
msgid "Right-clicking"
msgstr "Botón secundario do rato"

#. Tag: secondary
#: commands.docbook:1119
#, no-c-format
msgid "Invoking Popup Menu for"
msgstr "Invocar o menú emerxente para"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open the <link linkend=\"popup-menu\">popup menu</link> for the location or "
"object nearest the mouse cursor."
msgstr ""
"Abrir o <link linkend=\"popup-menu\">menú emerxente</link> da localización "
"ou obxecto máis próximo do cursor do rato."

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1125
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scrolling the mouse wheel"
msgstr "Mover a rodiña do rato"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Zoom the display in or out. If you do not have a mouse wheel, you can hold "
"the middle mouse button and drag vertically."
msgstr ""
"Alonxarse ou achegarse. Se non se ten rodiña no rato pódese premer o botón "
"centrar e arrastrar na vertical."

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1132
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click-and-dragging"
msgstr "Premer e arrastrar"

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1135
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dragging the sky map"
msgstr "Arrastrar o mapa do ceo"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1136
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pan the display, following the drag motion."
msgstr "Mover o visor, seguindo o movemento de arrastre."

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1139
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Ctrl;+dragging the sky map"
msgstr "&Ctrl;+arrastrar o mapa do ceo"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1140
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Define a rectangle in the map. When the mouse button is released, the "
"display is zoomed in to match the field-of-view to the bounds of the "
"rectangle."
msgstr ""
"Definir unh rectángulo no mapa. Cando se solta o botón, o visor amplíase "
"para que o campo de visión fique dentro dos límites do rectángulo."

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1145
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dragging an Info Box"
msgstr "Arrastrar un panel informativo"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1146
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Info Box is repositioned in the map. Info Boxes will <quote>stick</"
"quote> to window edges, so that they remain on the edge when the window is "
"resized."
msgstr ""
"O panel informativo recolócase no mapa. Os paneis informativos "
"<quote>apéganse</quote> aos bordos das xanelas, de xeito que fiquen no bordo "
"cando se amplía ou reduce a xanela."

